      "unitRules": [
        {
          "name": "Fabricator Claw Array",
          "text": "The values in brackets associated with any variants of the Battlesmith (X) and Fabricator (X) Special Rules of any model equipped with a Fabricator Claw Array are doubled."
        },
        {
          "name": "Fabricator (X)",
          "text": "In the Controlling Player's Movement Phase as the Active Player, when a model with the Fabricator (X) Special Rule has been selected, but before or after it has been moved, the Controlling Player can Activate this Special Rule. Once Activated, the controlling player of the Model with the Fabricator (X) special rule (referred to as the 'Acting Model') selects one friendly Unit with the Reanimant Trait within 6\" of the Acting Model. Once a Target Unit has been selected, the Controlling Player makes a number of Resurrection (4+) Tests for the Target Unit equal to the value in brackets associated with the variant of the Fabricator (X) Special Rule of the Acting Model. If a model with the Fabricator (X) Special Rule also has the Battlesmith (X) Special Rule, the model's Battlesmith (X) Special Rule may not be Activated in the same Phase as its Fabricator (X) Special Rule."
        },
        {
          "name": "Canoptek Hive",
          "text": "In the Controlling Player's Movement Phase as the Active Player, when a model with the Canoptek Hive has been selected, but before or after it has been moved, the controlling player may Target one friendly unit of Canoptek Scarabs within 6\" of the model with the Canoptek Hive Special Rule (referred to as the 'Acting Model'). Add one Scarab Swarm Model to the Target Unit so that it is in coherency with the Target Unit and wholly within 6\" of the Acting Model, then take an Intelligence Check for the Acting Model. If successful, nothing happens. If failed, 1 Damage is inflicted to the Acting Model. No Saving Throw or Damage Mitigation Roll may be taken against that Damage."
        }
      ],
